==Quests==
Talk to [[Josin Faithbringer]] in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'hail Josin Faithbringer'
:''Josin Faithbringer says 'Greetings, Xekl .  Are you ready to begin your test of faith? ''
You say, 'I am ready to begin the test of faith'
:''Josin Faithbringer says 'I have faith that you will do well.  Choose Alan or Deric. ''

= Alan Harten =

You say, 'I choose alan'
:''Josin Faithbringer says 'Take and read this book. When you are done, hand it back to me and I will summon him.'' 
:''Josin Faithbringer says 'Farewell. ''
:''Alan Harten says 'Faith is the key. ''
You say, 'hail Alan Harten'
:''Alan Harten says 'Greetings, faithful.  Your faith shall be tested this day.  Shall you take the test of courage, skill, protection or have you already proven your faith and wish to see what I have to trade? ''
You say, 'I wish to see what you have to trade'
:''Alan Harten says 'So the faithful has returned for a trade, eh?  Well, I am willing to upgrade the Darkwood Aegis or the Glowing Pauldrons for one of such devout faith.''  

== Cleric Test of Courage ==

Alan Harten says 'You have come seeking the knowledge and treasures I possess.  I will impart such things to you, if you do a service to your god.  It matters not who that god may be, but the service and the faith you must exemplify.  Bring to me an ochre tessera, a sky emerald, and a silver hoop. 

'''Reward:''' {{:Truewind Earring}}

