= Deric Lennox =

You say, 'I choose deric'
:''Josin Faithbringer says 'Take and read this book. When you are done, hand it back to me and I will summon him. ''
:''Josin Faithbringer says 'Farewell. ''
:''Deric Lennox says 'Faith is the key. ''
You say, 'hail Deric Lennox'
:''Deric Lennox says 'Greetin's there, lad.  Come seekin' glory then, have ye?  So be it then, glorious ye shall be.  Take me tests here, and I will show ye the light.  Will ye be takin' the test of resolution, of theurgy, or of the weak? Or maybe ye already have gotten your glory and wish to trade some of spoils for items of more use to you.'' 
You say, 'I wish to trade'
:''Deric Lennox says 'Bring me Theurgist or a Truwian Baton and I will upgrade them to something a bit more useful.'' 

